CVE-2026-8927

A vulnerability exists in the web-based management and services functions of RTU500 using libcurl library. When reusing a libcurl handle for sequential transfers with environment-variable proxy configuration, libcurl may fail to clear proxy authentication state between requests. This can leak the Proxy-Authorization header intended for one proxy to another proxy.

