CVE-2026-8932

A vulnerability exists in the web-based management and services functions of RTU500 using libcurl library. libcurl may reuse an existing connection even after mTLS-related configuration options, especially client certificate or private key settings, have changed. This can bypass the intended authentication configuration and allow use of a connection that should no longer be reused.

